<title>DENMARK: CYCLING-MINALI WINS FIRST STAGE OF TOUR OF DENMARK.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-MINALI WINS FIRST STAGE OF TOUR OF DENMARK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nicola Minali of Italy won the 163.6 km first stage of the Tour of Denmark cycling race between Horsens and Esbjerg on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The 859 km race, with 96 participants, ends in Copenhagen on August 10.</p>
